ApnaSathi database migrations

Run from the repository root after installing backend/requirements.txt and setting
DATABASE_URL (or DB_HOST/DB_NAME/DATABASE_CREDENTIALS):

    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head

The initial migration enables PostgreSQL's pgvector extension and creates all
application tables. For RDS PostgreSQL, use the managed master role for the
initial extension setup if the application role cannot create extensions.
